<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of New Mexico exports to Mexico, to March 15 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     660	     6,335	 N/A</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   0	 N/A</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    31	     1,701	 N/A</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females     0	     1,123	 N/A</p>
